        "collapsible_item_7zrKY8": {
          "type": "collapsible_item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "What is included in a dining room set?",
            "content": "<p>The pieces included vary by product. A 5-piece dining set usually contains one dining table and four chairs, while a 7-piece dining set usually contains one table and six chairs. Check the individual product description for the exact pieces included.</p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "page": "",
            "open": false,
            "use_subtext_color": false
          }
        },
        "collapsible_item_DreDtr": {
          "type": "collapsible_item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "What is the difference between a dining room set and a dining table set?",
            "content": "<p>The terms are often used interchangeably. Both usually refer to a coordinated dining table and chair combination. A broader dining room set may also include a bench, sideboard or other dining room furniture.</p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "page": "",
            "open": false,
            "use_subtext_color": false
          }
        },
        "collapsible_item_HP9BbW": {
          "type": "collapsible_item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "Should I choose a dining room set for four or six people?",
            "content": "<p>A four-person set is a practical option for apartments, breakfast areas and smaller families. A six-person set provides more seating for larger households, guests and regular entertaining.</p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "page": "",
            "open": false,
            "use_subtext_color": false
          }
        },
        "collapsible_item_D4W6bq": {
          "type": "collapsible_item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "How much space should I leave around a dining room set?",
            "content": "<p>Leave enough room for chairs to pull out comfortably and for people to walk behind seated guests. Always compare the full table and chair dimensions with the available room measurements before ordering.</p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "page": "",
            "open": false,
            "use_subtext_color": false
          }
        },
        "collapsible_item_6qB3JR": {
          "type": "collapsible_item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "Can I mix a COLAMY dining table with different dining chairs?",
            "content": "<p>Yes. You can browse our <a href=\"/collections/dining-tables\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Dining Tables\">dining tables </a>and <a href=\"/collections/dining-chairs\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Dining Chairs\">dining chairs </a>separately to build your own combination. Compare table height, chair seat height, width, color and finish before ordering.</p>",
            "custom_liquid": "",
            "page": "",
            "open": false,
            "use_subtext_color": false
          }
        },
        "collapsible_item_8nPM9a": {
          "type": "collapsible_item",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "heading": "Do the dining tables and chairs require assembly?",
            "content": "<p>Assembly requirements vary by product. Review the assembly information on the individual product page to see which pieces require installation and which tools or hardware are included.</p>",
